    <value>Getting started</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Dialog.Help.GettingStarted.Detail" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>- Open a folder from [File] &gt; [Open folder...] to load your photos.
- You can also drag and drop a folder into the app.
- Select a photo to see the preview and map on the right.
- Pins appear only for photos that include location data.
- Optional: set Windows file associations to open photos with PhotoGeoExplorer.</value>
  </data>
